bruk-cursor-termux
==================

This repository ships Termux / Bionic compatibility glue only
(installer, launcher, Node preload, JS stubs).

Cursor Agent is proprietary software owned by Anysphere / Cursor.
This project downloads the official agent package from Cursor's servers
at install time. It does not redistribute the agent binary or source.

Not affiliated with Anysphere or Cursor.

The approach follows the public cursor-termux installer
(https://github.com/Afnanksalal/cursor-termux, MIT) and adds patches
needed on this Termux install (tree-sitter stubs, no global
LD_LIBRARY_PATH so Termux-X11 is unaffected).
